#X text 20 2090 unload <slot> (route outlet 5) \, query (outlet 6) -- 2026-09-18 sample-memory item. mlrv-fplen tracks last-loaded frames per slot (0 = empty\, table inits 0). unload gates 0..7 (out-of-range ignored) then resize-1 / set / zero-cell-0 / resize-64 (grow zero-fills \, shrink retains -- resize alone never silences) \, stores 0 \, reports loaded <slot> 0 so mapping.pd auto-marks the slot empty. query dumps tracked occupancy ascending. dynamic \; \$1 sends need symbol-wrapped names (bare symbols fail \$1 substitution) -- all probed first.;
